  <entity00139214:DescriptionOfCategorizationOfCashAndCashEquivalentsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoriesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dFQ_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">현금및예치금에 계상된 현금및현금성자산을 상각후원가측정예치금과 동일하게 상각후원가측정금융자산으로 분류하였습니다.</entity00139214:DescriptionOfCategorizationOfCashAndCashEquivalentsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoriesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems>
