  <entity00139214: contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_MeasurementAxis_ifrs-full_NotMeasuredAtFairValueInStatementOfFinancialPositionButForWhichFairValueIsDisclosedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfAssetsAxis_entity00139214_CashAndDueFromBanksMemberOfFinancialAssetsAtAmortisedCostClassMemberOfDisclosureOfFairValueByHierarchyAssetsNotMeasuredAtFairValueInStatementOfFinancialPositionButForWhichFairValueIsDisclosedTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">현금및현금성자산은 장부가액과 공정가치가 동일하며, 예치금은 단기성 예치금이 대부분이므로 공정가치의 대용치로 장부금액을 사용하였습니다.</entity00139214:>
